ableau, Fichiers, Documents, Discussions.\n\n## Constants / roles\n`src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts` (all UUIDs `c31b…`), `field-vocabulary.ts` (status/health options). Behavior: trash retention 7 days, human-id max 10 attempts, recurring window 24 h / max 1000, timer storage key `a2e-projects-running-timer`, min 1 minute, retroplanning default 18:00, Gantt 36 px/day. `roles/default-function.role.ts`: read/update/soft-delete all records, no destroy. Tests: 20 node:test files covering views, commands, lib engines and handlers.\n</task_result>\n</task>"
