        "result": "<task id=\"ses_f46b09d3fffeScL6ypj4svQpTY\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n# A2E Projects (`packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-projects/`)\n\nApp id `4f759655-…` (`src/application.config.ts`): \"A2E Projects\", \"Projets & tâches 2.0\". All labels are French.\n\n## Objects (`src/objects/`)\nSix `defineObject`s; none extends native task — the app instead **pins fields on standard task** via `src/fields/*`.\n- `project` (Projet/Projets, `IconKanban`): `name` TEXT, `key` TEXT (task-id prefix), `taskCounter` NUMBER, `status` SELECT (PLANNING/ACTIVE/ON_HOLD/COMPLETED), `health` SELECT (ON_TRACK/AT_RISK/OFF_TRACK), `startsAt`/`dueAt` DATE_TIME, `color` TEXT, `description` RICH_TEXT, `budget`/`spent` CURRENCY, `archivedAt` DATE_TIME; relations `lead`→workspaceMember, `company`→company, `documents`→external A2E Documents object (`c31a…`).\n- `milestone` (Jalon/Jalons): `name`, `dueAt`, `doneAt`, `archivedAt`; `project` FK SET_NULL.\n- `projectMember` (Membre projet/Membres projet): `memberRole` SELECT MEMBER/LEAD/GUEST; `project` and `workspaceMember` FKs CASCADE (junction).\n- `timeEntry` (Temps/Temps): `label`, `minutes` NUMBER, `spentAt`, `archivedAt`; `task`/`project` SET_NULL, `teamMember`→workspaceMember CASCADE.\n- `label` (Étiquette/Étiquettes): `name`, `color`, `archivedAt`; `taskLabel` one-to-many.\n- `taskLabel` (Étiquette de tâche): junction `label`/`task` FKs CASCADE.\n\nTask extension fields: `project`, `projectStatus` (TODO/IN_PROGRESS/DONE), `priority` (URGENT/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), `estimate`, `estimateLabel` (XS–XL), `blockIssue`→note, `milestone`, `parentTask`/`subtasks` self-relation, `taskLabels`, `humanId`, `retroplanningProvenance`, `timeEntries`.\n\n## Views (`src/views/`)\n`all-projects`, `all-milestones`, `all-labels` (TABLE); `task-board` (KANBAN on `projectStatus`, project-scoped); `task-calendar` (CALENDAR, month, `dueAt`, not DONE, project non-empty); my-tasks variants `my-tasks` \"Assignées à moi\" (assignee = current member), `created-by-me` \"Créées par moi\" (createdBy.workspaceMemberId), `overdue-tasks` \"En retard\" (`dueAt` in past, status ≠ DONE) — all TABLE; `current-tasks` \"Tâches courantes\"; `project-tasks` \"Tâches projet\" TABLE (project page tab).\n\n## Navigation & Command menu\nNav (`src/navigation-menu-items/`): `Projects` VIEW→allProjects (pos 110); `Mes tâches` FOLDER (pos 120) containing Assignées à moi / Créées par moi / En retard.\nCommands (`src/command-menu-items/`): create-project GLOBAL, create-task GLOBAL, go-to-projects GLOBAL, open-subtasks GLOBAL, open-time-tracker RECORD_SELECTION on task.\n\n## Logic functions, workflow, post-install\n`src/logic-functions/`:\n- `post-install` (`definePostInstallLogicFunction`) seeds two starter projects LIV + EVT with 5 tasks and 3 milestones each (`src/lib/starter-projects.ts`), idempotent by `key`.\n- `purge-projects-trash`: cron `30 3 * * *`; destroys archived projects/milestones/timeEntries/labels past 7 days.\n- `task-human-id`: DB event `task.*`; CAS-allocates `KEY-n`.\n- `recurring-task-generator`: `workflowActionTriggerSettings`; paired with `src/workflow-templates/recurring-task-generator.workflow.ts` (CRON DAYS default day 1, 07:00, one LOGIC_FUNCTION step).\n- `retroplanning`: no trigger settings declared (uncertain how dispatched); handler applies recipes `delivery`/`event`.\n- `extract-tasks-from-document`: `toolTriggerSettings` AI tool, explicitly inert `STUB_NOT_IMPLEMENTED`.\n\n## Front components (`src/front-components/`)\n`create-project-command`, `create-task-command`, `go-to-projects` (navigate), `project-overview` (chips/counters/members), `project-time-rollup`, `project-gantt` (virtualized bars + `parentTask` arrows), `task-subtasks` (forest, cycle guard), `time-tracker` (start/stop, entries).\n\n## Page layout\n`src/page-layouts/project.page-layout.ts` — \"Project Record Page\" tabs: Accueil (fields, rich text, overview, Temps), Timeline (timeline, tasks, jalons, étiquettes, notes, Gantt), Tâches, Tableau, Fichiers, Documents, Discussions.\n\n## Constants / roles\n`src/constants/universal-identifiers.ts` (all UUIDs `c31b…`), `field-vocabulary.ts` (status/health options). Behavior: trash retention 7 days, human-id max 10 attempts, recurring window 24 h / max 1000, timer storage key `a2e-projects-running-timer`, min 1 minute, retroplanning default 18:00, Gantt 36 px/day. `roles/default-function.role.ts`: read/update/soft-delete all records, no destroy. Tests: 20 node:test files covering views, commands, lib engines and handlers.\n</task_result>\n</task>"
