        "result": "<task id=\"ses_f46b0975dffegqWBIzkZ5cilQs\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nResearch complete. Findings below; all paths are relative to `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite`.\n\n## A2E Drive (`packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-drive/src`)\n- **App**: `application.config.ts` `defineApplication`, id `b11cd01f-75de-4acd-8e67-0e9c484fde02`, displayName \"A2E Drive\".\n- **Objects**: only `objects/drive-folder.object.ts` → `driveFolder`/`driveFolders` (Dossier/Dossiers, IconFolder). Fields: `name` (label id), `icon`, `color`, `archivedAt`; self-relation `parent` (MANY_TO_ONE, join `parentFolderId`, CASCADE) / `children` (ONE_TO_MANY); `files` ONE_TO_MANY → standard `attachment`.\n- **Fields on standard `attachment`**: `folder` (MANY_TO_ONE join `folderId`, SET_NULL), `archivedAt`, `description`, `sourceApp` (TEXT), `starred` (BOOLEAN).\n- **Views**: `all-drive-folders.view.ts` \"Tous les dossiers\" (TABLE, sort name ASC; name/parent/color/icon, side panel); `all-drive-files.view.ts` \"Tous les fichiers\" on `attachment` (name/folder/sourceApp/starred/description, side panel).\n- **Navigation**: `drive.navigation-menu-item.ts` \"Drive\", position 140, type VIEW → `allDriveFolders`. No command-menu items, front components, page-layout-tabs, or post-install.\n- **Logic functions**: `purge-drive-trash.ts` (cron `0 3 * * *`, 120s) → handler `purgeDriveExpiredTrash` purges `driveFolders`/`attachments` archived >7 days; `guard-drive-folder-parent-cycle.ts` (database event `driveFolder.updated`, updatedFields `parent`/`parentId`/`parentFolderId`) → `repairFolderParentCycle`. Libs: `lib/drive-folder-cycle.ts`, `lib/drive-trash-retention.ts` (`TRASH_RETENTION_DAYS = 7`).\n- **Page layout**: `drive-folder.page-layout.ts` – tabs Accueil (FIELDS) and Chronologie (TIMELINE).\n- **Role**: `roles/default-function.role.ts` – read/update/soft-delete all, no destroy.\n\n## A2E Chat (`packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-chat/src`)\n- **App**: `application.config.ts`, id `e2dce399-87f1-4548-b307-5f368b4d5dd4`, \"A2E Chat\".\n- **Objects**: `chatChannel` (name, `kind` WORKSPACE/PROJECT/CUSTOM, `visibility` PUBLIC/PRIVATE, `topic`, `postingRoles` MULTI_SELECT, messages/members/readCursors, `project`→A2E Projects, `company`→standard company); `chatChannelMember` (memberRole OWNER/MEMBER, joinedAt, channel, workspaceMember); `chatMessage` (body Markdown-lite, editedAt, channel, author, threadParent/threadReplies, reactions, readCursors); `chatReaction` (emoji, message, workspaceMember); `chatReadCursor` (lastReadAt, channel, workspaceMember, lastReadMessage).\n- **Fields on standard objects**: workspaceMember → `chatChannelMemberships`, `chatMessages`, `chatReactions`, `chatReadCursors`; project → `discussions`; company → `discussions`.\n- **Views**: `all-channels`, `all-channel-members`, `all-messages` (all TABLE, side panel).\n- **Navigation / commands**: `channels.navigation-menu-item.ts` \"Discussions\", position 130 → allChannels. `create-channel.command-menu-item.ts` + `create-channel-command.front-component.tsx` (`createChatChannels` then navigate `RecordShowPage`); `go-to-chat...` navigates `RecordIndexPage` `chatChannels`.\n- **Logic**: `logic-functions/post-install.ts` is a `definePostInstallLogicFunction` → `syncStarterChannels` seeds idempotently \"Général\" and \"Annonces\" (`lib/starter-channels.ts`). Libs: `channel-membership.ts`, `message-body.ts` (mentions `@[label](id)`, max 4000).\n- **Page layouts**: `chat-channel.page-layout.ts` (FIELDS+TIMELINE); `chat-message.page-layout.ts` (FIELDS+FILES); `page-layout-tabs/company-discussions.page-layout-tab.ts` adds DISCUSSIONS widget to the standard company record page.\n- **Role**: same read/update/soft-delete/no-destroy role.\n\n## Front surfaces\n- **Drive** – `pages/drive/DrivePage.tsx`, route `AppPath.Drive = '/drive'`. Sidebar `DriveFolderTree`, `DriveBreadcrumb`, list/gallery, trash view, bulk actions, upload queue. Data: `modules/drive/hooks/useDriveFolders`/`useDriveFiles` (`useFindManyRecords` on `driveFolder`/`attachment`), `useDriveActions` (`useUpdateOneRecord`/`useCreateOneRecord`), `useDriveUploadQueue` + `useFileUpload`, preview via global `filePreviewState`. Workbench widget `registerDriveUsageWidget` (`DRIVE_USAGE_WIDGET_ID = 'drive-usage'`). **No realtime topic.**\n- **Discussions** – `pages/chat/ChatPage.tsx`, route `AppPath.Discussions = '/discussions'`. Channel sidebar + `ChatChannelConversation` (composer, mention candidates, threads, presence). GraphQL: `CHAT_MESSAGES_QUERY` (`chatMessages(channelId,limit,after)` custom resolver), `CHAT_UNREAD_COUNTS_QUERY`, `SEND_CHAT_TYPING_INDICATOR_MUTATION`; writes `chatMessage`/`chatReadCursor` via object-record hooks. Realtime topic `workspace:<id>:chat:<channelId>` (`useChatChannelLive`), event types `chat.message.created/updated/deleted`, `chat.typing`, `chat.read.updated`, `chat.reaction.created/deleted`. Record surfaces: `DiscussionsWidget` + `useRecordChatChannels` (provisions PROJECT/CUSTOM channel) opened in the side panel.\n- **Inbox** – `pages/inbox/InboxPage.tsx`, route `AppPath.Inbox = '/inbox'`. Category tabs all/mentions/assigned/watching, day groups, bulk mark-read/archive. GraphQL: `InboxNotifications` (`notifications(includeArchived)`), `InboxUnreadCount` (`notificationUnreadCount`), `MarkInboxNotificationsAsRead`, `ArchiveInboxNotifications`. Realtime topic `workspace:<id>:inbox:<userId>` (`useInboxLive`).\n\n**Uncertainty**: the chat/inbox queries call server custom resolvers (`chatMessages`, `chatUnreadCounts`, `sendChatTypingIndicator`, `notifications`, `notificationUnreadCount`); I did not inspect `twenty-server` to confirm their implementations beyond the front-end references.\n</task_result>\n</task>"
